    "catalogue_description": "Description nazi_zombie_rage is a large scale zombie map. your goal is to defend the train terminal from the hordes of zombie intruders! This is an old school zombie map, free of perks and Verruckt features to help you out. The ray gun only exists in the weapons box. Without cheats enabled, the map is meant to be difficult. nazi_zombie_rage is based on the WaW multiplayer map \u2018Station\u2019. There are several playing areas and tons of things to explore and open. Good luck! Features -Mystery Box -Wall Guns",
